#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:5
#: 50b623b2bfd94c7e9427e9a9f1e65342
msgid "Storage and EEPROM management"
msgstr "存储与 EEPROM 管理"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:7
#: 94e5c313db954daea97b464f5e738699
msgid ""
"Every board that ArduPilot supports has some form of persistent storage "
"available. This is used to hold user parameters, waypoints, rally points, "
"terrain data and many other useful things. To provide access to this storage"
" ArduPilot has 4 basic mechanisms:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"支持的每块主板都提供某种形式的持久存储。这用于保存用户参数、航点、集结点、地形数据以及许多其他有用信息。为访问这些存储，ArduPilot 提供了 4 "
"种基本机制："

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:12
#: ee7fbef47de94df9926be2416d2ed8d1
msgid "the AP_HAL::Storage object, accessed as hal.storage"
msgstr "AP_HAL::Storage 对象，通过 hal.storage 访问"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:13
#: fe5e7be0701249b892d843ab6856de65
msgid ""
"the StorageManager library to give a higher level abstraction layer on "
"hal.storage"
msgstr "StorageManager 库，为 hal.storage 提供更高层次的抽象层"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:15
#: 1e2a41511a1b4db1be56a4fb3737c198
msgid "DataFlash for storing to an on-board logging area"
msgstr "DataFlash，用于写入板载日志区域"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:16
#: 7c19daa9772b484da588a66aff9fe379
msgid ""
"Posix IO functions to traditional filesystems (for example VFAT on a microSD"
" card), on boards that support it"
msgstr "Posix IO 函数，用于访问传统文件系统（例如 microSD 卡上的 VFAT），适用于支持此功能的主板"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:19
#: 7cd80c42d67b42bba5b2f8c01a23ad37
msgid ""
"The other libraries and functions that need persistent storage are built on "
"these basic systems. For example, the AP_Param library (which handles user "
"settable parameters) is built on top of StorageManager, which in turn is "
"built on top of AP_HAL::Storage. The AP_Terrain library (which handles "
"terrain data) is built on top of Posix IO functions for holding the terrain "
"database."
msgstr ""
"其他需要持久存储的库和函数均构建于这些基础系统之上。例如，AP_Param 库（处理用户可设置参数）构建在 StorageManager "
"之上，后者又构建在 AP_HAL::Storage 之上。AP_Terrain 库（处理地形数据）构建在 Posix IO "
"函数之上，用于存储地形数据库。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:27
#: 90b025e3cc594e768f65bb2712ee1159
msgid "The AP_HAL::Storage library"
msgstr "AP_HAL::Storage 库"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:29
#: c88feb1cc7ed4e1b9238f32cf532224b
msgid ""
"The AP_HAL::Storage object is available on all platforms. The minimum size "
"of storage available via this interface on boards that ArduPilot supports is"
" 4096 bytes. Some boards provide more space - for example the PX4v1 has 8k "
"of EEPROM and the Pixhawk has 16k of FRAM. All of that is hidden behind the "
"AP_HAL::Storage API."
msgstr ""
"AP_HAL::Storage 对象在所有平台上均可使用。ArduPilot 支持的主板通过此接口可用的最小存储空间为 4096 "
"字节。某些主板提供更多空间——例如 PX4v1 有 8K EEPROM，Pixhawk 有 16K FRAM。所有这些细节都隐藏在 "
"AP_HAL::Storage API 背后。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:35
#: 40adf2b5c4c743cb8c2eb039cde72d9e
msgid "The hal.storage API is extremely simple. It has just 3 functions"
msgstr "hal.storage API 极为简单，只有 3 个函数"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:37
#: 8c860e051dd1474188656118a80887d8
msgid "init() to start up the storage subsystem"
msgstr "init()，启动存储子系统"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:38
#: c88b036600d34f65b2e6167dd19cdb60
msgid "read_block() to read a block of bytes"
msgstr "read_block()，读取一段字节数据"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:39
#: 82126cec4dd34a2abff93230a444f299
msgid "write_block() to write a block of bytes"
msgstr "write_block()，写入一段字节数据"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:41
#: 502f3ee80f784062a20826fd7283bbc3
msgid ""
"The reason for this very simple API is that developers are encouraged to use"
" the StorageManager API instead of hal.storage. You should only be delving "
"into hal.storage when doing bringup of a new board, or when debugging."
msgstr ""
"之所以 API 如此简单，是因为鼓励开发者使用 StorageManager API 而非直接使用 "
"hal.storage。只有在对新主板进行初始调试或排查问题时，才需要深入研究 hal.storage。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:46
#: 585172579e754454b561b1a36a6698e5
msgid ""
"The size of storage available is set inside `AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h>`__"
" in the macro HAL_STORAGE_SIZE. This means we don't yet support dynamically "
"determining the size of storage available for this interface. If you want "
"dynamically sized storage you need to use Posix IO for now."
msgstr ""
"可用存储的大小在 `AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h>`__"
" 中的宏 HAL_STORAGE_SIZE 里设置。这意味着我们目前不支持动态确定此接口可用存储的大小。如果需要动态大小的存储，目前需要使用 Posix"
" IO。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:53
#: afcd26e3421846228216a46aa286b7cf
msgid ""
"We don't have an example sketch for the AP_HAL::Storage API, so this is your"
" chance to write one. If you have gotten this far into the ArduPilot "
"tutorial you should have seen enough example sketches to know how to write "
"one from scratch. So write a libraries/AP_HAL/examples/Storage example that "
"calculates an 8 bit XOR of the full contents of the hal.storage data, and "
"prints it to the console. Then :ref:`submit the example as a patch "
"<submitting-patches-back-to-master>` to the ArduPilot github, being careful "
"to follow the patch submission guidelines."
msgstr ""
"我们目前没有 AP_HAL::Storage API 的示例草图，这正是您编写一个的机会。如果您已学习到 ArduPilot "
"教程的这一步，应该已经看过足够多的示例草图，知道如何从头编写。所以请编写一个 libraries/AP_HAL/examples/Storage "
"示例，计算 hal.storage 数据完整内容的 8 位异或值，并将其打印到控制台。然后 :ref:`将该示例作为补丁提交 <submitting-"
"patches-back-to-master>` 到 ArduPilot GitHub，注意遵循补丁提交指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:62
#: b53ccd31b5e24a7996da25c3fe8cff9b
msgid ""
"I will be quite interested to see how long after I add this exercise to the "
"tutorial before we get a submission ...."
msgstr "我很想知道，在我将这个练习加入教程之后，多久会收到第一个提交……"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:66
#: c023f187b91f46a18ffeb959d4d74e24
msgid "The StorageManager library"
msgstr "StorageManager 库"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:68
#: c8cc0f80805f47fb9a9a67e7e2f9c15a
msgid ""
"The simple hal.storage API makes it nice and easy to port ArduPilot to a new"
" board, but isn't convenient for actually using the available storage. For "
"that we have StorageManager. The StorageManager library provides an API "
"which abstracts the storage into pseudo-contiguous blocks of data that have "
"an assigned purpose. So we chop up the available storage into areas that "
"provide:"
msgstr ""
"简单的 hal.storage API 使得将 ArduPilot 移植到新主板变得方便快捷，但对于实际使用可用存储来说并不方便。为此，我们有 "
"StorageManager。StorageManager 库提供一个 "
"API，将存储抽象为具有指定用途的伪连续数据块。因此，我们将可用存储划分为以下用途的区域："

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:75
#: 48ae40c53b5f4f0c86e628953640d9ff
msgid "parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-storage-and-eeprom-management.rst:76
